---
source: tests/sync/write_cargo_toml.rs
expression: "apply(PKG, &patch)"
---
## Input

```toml
[package]
name = "x"
version = "0.1"
```

## Patch

```
deps:
  - a@1 require_features=["wasm"]
  - b@1 require_features=["wasm"]
```

## Output

```toml
[package]
name = "x"
version = "0.1"

[dependencies]
a = { version = "1", optional = true }
b = { version = "1", optional = true }

[features]
wasm = ["dep:a", "dep:b"]
```
